{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=civilian,family",{"I can't, I can't, I'm sorry! Run!","Go, go, everybody go!","No! I'm getting out of here!","Run! Just run!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=worker",{"To hell with this, run!","Not my fight - I'm leaving","Come on, let's go! Move!","Out of here - now!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=rescue",{"We have to get out of here - go!","Go, everyone, go!","Please, please just let us leave!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=law,swat",{"Fall back! Fall back now!","Pull back, get clear!","Move! Get to cover!","Fall back!! Get to cover!!","Fall back, fall back!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=military,elite",{"Pull back - move, move!","Withdraw, now!","Pull back, pull back, fall back!","Pull back, pull back!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=military,elite|world=road",{"Fall back to the road, go!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Screw this - run!","Not worth it, scatter!","{he}'s crazy, get out of here!","Move, move, move!","Fuck this, run!","Scatter, scatter, we meet up later, GO!","Fuck this, scatter!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'm not staying here!","Oh God, scatter, scatter, split up!!","I can't, I can't, I'm out of here!!","RUN!! Go, go, GET OUT OF HERE!!","You're not catching me!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Move, move, run, run, don't look back!","Screw this, I'm gone!","Scatter, scatter, meet up later!","Move, move, move, now!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FLEE","reg=family",{"Children, run, run, go, go!","Kids, RUN!! Go on, I'm right behind you!"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=civilian,family",{"I thought {he}'d shoot us, I really did","My hands won't stop shaking","We're alive - we're alive","Okay, breathe - {he}'s gone"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=worker",{"That went bad, but we walk away","Things are just things - we're breathing","I'll be watching my back from now on"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=rescue",{"Everybody alright? Count off - is everybody here?","Thank God nobody was hurt","Check each other for wounds, then we move"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=law,swat",{"Everybody okay? Report","We keep eyes open for that one","Remember the face, we'll see {him} again","Everyone alright? Count off","Everyone alright? Report in","Everyone alright? Report"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=military,elite",{"Status - anyone hit?","Not doing that again, no {sir}!","Not a word, just walk","Status report, all present?","Safe distance, status report","Status report, all accounted for?"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Next time {he} won't be so lucky","We'll be careful with that one from now on","Everybody in one piece? Good","That was a close one, anyone hurt?","Phew, that was close, anybody bleeding?","Phew, that was close, anyone bleeding?"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"{he}'s gone... {he}'s really gone, oh thank God, we're okay","Is {he} gone? Is {he} really gone? Oh God, I'm shaking, I'm shaking so hard","We're alive, we're alive, that's the main thing, we're alive","Heads, count heads!! Is everybody here? Anybody missing?","They're gone... Christ, I thought that was it"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"{he} took the stuff, but we kept the skin, count your blessings","Well, {he} got the stuff, but we're still breathing, that's something","Damn, damn, damn, at least we've got our lives","Everybody okay? Anyone hurt? Check yourselves","{he} got the stuff, but we kept our skin, that's something","Count heads, count heads, who's missing?"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RELIEF","reg=family",{"Thank the Lord, thank the Lord, we're all together"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=civilian,family",{"Please don't follow us! Please!","{he} took everything - run, just run","Oh God, go, GO, don't stop","Don't look back - just go","We're alive - keep going"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=worker",{"Damn thief, keep moving","Years of work, gone - just go","Don't turn around, walk fast","Leave it, leave it, let's go"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=rescue",{"We're alive, that's what matters - go","Quickly, before {he} changes {his} mind","Stay together, keep moving"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=law,swat",{"We'll remember your face - fall back","Pull back, this isn't over","Move, get distance, eyes on {him}","I'll hunt {him} down, mark my words","{he}'s marked, {he}'s a dead {g:man|woman} walking, I'll find {him}"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=military,elite",{"Fall back - keep your eyes on {him}","We regroup and we remember this","Disengage - move","Regroup, we'll deal with this later","Withdrawing, regroup at the rally point","Regroup, regroup, move"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You're a dead {g:man|woman} - remember that","This isn't over, not even close","Take it, hope it chokes you","Move out, we'll find {him} later","{he} had the nerve to rob US, {he}'s a dead {g:man|woman}","Boys, we've been robbed, can you believe it?! Robbed!","{he} robbed us, can you believe it? ROBBED us!"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"{he} took it all!! Every last bit, God, I can't stop shaking","RUN!! Just run, c'mon, c'mon, don't turn around!!","{he} took everything, everything, we've got to go, we've got to go now!!","Oh God, run, run, {he} might change {his} mind!","I'll remember your face!! I'll remember your face, you hear me?!","{he} cleaned us out!! Everything we had!! Go, GO!","Please don't let {him} come after us, Jesus, please"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"That bastard, that low-down bastard, I'll remember {his} face","We were robbed in broad daylight, can you believe it?!","Go, just walk, {he}'s got what {he} wants- keep walking","That son of a bitch, that low-life piece of shit, I'll find {him}","Go, go, go, get out of {his} sight","Go, go, {he} might change {his} mind","Son of a bitch took it all, damn {him} to hell"}},
{"ORD_ROBBED_RUN","reg=family",{"Come, children, hurry, hurry, don't look at {him}","Quick, children, quick, don't look at {him}"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Take it, take it, it's all yours, please just don't hurt me","Everything, take everything, I don't care anymore","That's all I have, honest, it's all I have","Everything, take everything, just let me go, please, let me go!","That's all I have, all of it, I'm sorry, it's not much"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"There, take it, you've got your loot, now go","Fine, pick it clean, vulture","That's everything, you got it, now go on","Fine, take it, you thief, you low-down thief"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=family",{"God forgive you, take it, take it all"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=law,swat",{"Take it, but you'll hang for this","You'll hang for this, take it and run","Fine, take it - you'll answer for this when it's over","I'll hand it over - don't lay a finger on me","Go ahead, take what you want, there'll be a reckoning, eventually"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=military,elite",{"Compliance, take it, you'll answer for this","Compliance, you'll answer for this","Take it, mark my face - I'll remember","Fine, you've got what you came for - now go","Take the gear, leave the people alone"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heh, you've got guts, kid, take it","Alright, take it, you win this time","Alright, take it, you're braver than you look","Take it, kid, but we'll meet again"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Take it! Take what you want, just don't hurt us!","Please, it's everything I've got - take it and go","Here! Here, take it, just let us live","I'm giving it to you - please, don't shoot"}},
{"ORD_ROB_OK","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Ha, a robber robbed - fine, take it","Take it, next time I'll be the one doing the taking","Fine, help yourself, no need to shoot"}},
