{"ORD_ZOMBIE_CANCEL","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"SHIT!! DEADS!! DEADS!!","OH- oh God, behind you, BEHIND YOU!!","RUN!! There's one!! RUN!!","No no no no, they're here, THEY'RE HERE!!","SHIT!! Deads!! Behind you, behind YOU!!","Oh God!! Oh God, oh God, they're coming, they're coming!!","SHIT- shit shit shit, I- hands down, hands DOWN, run!!","Aaah!! There's one!! There's one right there!!","No no no no- dead, dead one, DEAD ONE!!"}},
