{"ORD_ZOMBIE_CANCEL","reg=law,swat",{"Dead ones! Stay away from them!","Infected, close, move!","Dead ones!! Infected!! Hands down, hands down, deal with it!","Dead one, dead one, right there, shoot it!","The dead! Keep them away from us!","Shit! Deads! Close, close!","Down, down! They're on us!","Damn it! Not now! Not now!"}},
