{"ORD_ZOMBIE_CANCEL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Fuck, dead ones!!","Shit, rotters, MOVE!","Fuck, dead ones!! Move!!","Shit, shit, shit, rotter, rotter!","Oh come ON, not now! Deads!"}},
